Drop exported Grafana dashboard JSON files here; they are auto-loaded into the
"Private Cloud" folder by ../provisioning/dashboards/dashboards.yml.

Recommended starting set (import by ID from grafana.com, then export to JSON
and commit the file so a rebuilt server comes back with the same dashboards):

  1860   Node Exporter Full          — host CPU/RAM/disk/network
  193    Docker + cAdvisor           — per-container resource use
  9628   PostgreSQL Database         — connections, transactions, cache hits
  20204  SMART disk health           — drive temperature, reallocated sectors

When importing, select the "Prometheus" datasource (uid: prometheus).
